<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED OCT 8.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED OCT 8.</headline>
<text>
<p>(Updates by figures for treasury paper yields)</p>
<p>Central exchange rate-Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) daily fix:</p>
<p>Levs/dollar 215.56 (Oct 8) 70.719(Dec30'95) 66.015(Dec30'94)</p>
<p>Broad money in billion levs:</p>
<p>846 (Sept27) 816.9 (Aug30) 769.9 (July26) 700.9 (June28)</p>
<p>M1 pct change  +4.43 (Sept27-Aug30)</p>
<p>M2 pct change  +3.37 (Sept27-Aug30)</p>
<p>Central bank total refinancing in billion levs:</p>
<p>61,149 (Sept27) 54.369 (Aug30) 61.450 (July26) 57.570 (June28)</p>
<p>Central interest rate (CIR): 300 pct (108 pct May 10-Sept 23)</p>
<p>BNB monthly repo rate: 18 pct (3-4 days); 23 pct (5-6 days)</p>
<p>Interbank annual repo rate (up to 14 days) - 301-302 pct</p>
<p>Money market lev funds rate - 301-308 pct annual</p>
<p>Average bank offered lev rate on term deposits of companies</p>
<p>and individuals, monthly pct - 20-22</p>
<p>Bank lending rates, annual pct - N.A</p>
